            <ArticleTitle>A review of cough in children.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>299-309</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cough is a very common symptom of respiratory disease and reason for parents to seek medical attention. The article presents broad clinical guidelines on the approach to childhood cough and discusses current controversies of the management of cough in children.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
